<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">shaman-routes</ansi>

The Shaman lineage splits at level 10 into a master of lightning, a weaver of
mist or a speaker of the earth. None of the three asks anything of your
alignment, at level 10 or at level 30.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Stormcaller</ansi>

  10 Chain lightning    Lightning also strikes a second foe for 50% of its damage
  15 Thunderhead        +10% spell damage
  20 Forked lightning   the second foe takes 75% of Lightning's damage
  25 Stormborn          +20% spell damage

  <ansi fg="yellow-bold">Tempest Lord</ansi> (30): Rain lasts the whole battle and lightning
  chains through a row (<ansi fg="command">help tempest-lord</ansi>).

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Mistweaver</ansi>

  10 Veil of mist       while its Fog lasts, allies gain +5 Evasion
  15 Long mist          its weather calls last a round longer
  20 Deep veil          Fog gives allies +8 Evasion
  25 Lingering weather  its weather calls last two rounds longer

  <ansi fg="yellow-bold">Veil Mother</ansi> (30): weather that lasts seven rounds, and a fog
  that hides the back row from extended reach (<ansi fg="command">help veil-mother</ansi>).

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Earthspeaker</ansi>

  10 Stoneskin          one ally gains +10 armor for the battle; chant 1, cost 8
                        (the Earthspeaker casts it on its own, as a Druid does Barkskin)
  15 Hard earth         Stoneskin gives +15 armor
  20 Steady ground      allies in its row take 5% less damage
  25 Deep roots         Stoneskin gives +20 armor

  <ansi fg="yellow-bold">Mountain Speaker</ansi> (30): Stoneskin over a whole row, and a
  tremor that may knock the front row down (<ansi fg="command">help mountain-speaker</ansi>).

At level 30 each route promotes again to its elite class (<ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>). Routes are final.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help shaman</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help classes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
